uot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;반도체 공정/장비 인력을 양성</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">하고자 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">정부지원으로&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">연수과정 전액 무료로 운영되며 교육장려금(최대300만원) 까지 지원</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">하며 수료 후에는&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">기업연수등 취업도 지원하고 있습니다.</span><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">어려운 시기에 취업을 도모하고자 실시하는 정부 국비지원 청년일자리 육성사업입니다.</span><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">취업 준비생들에게 좋은 기회가 될 수 있도록 많은 관심 및 안내 부탁 드립니다.</span><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">해당 교육 과정 홈페이지 링크도 같이 보내드립니다.</span></p><div style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-size: 13px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; vertical-align: baseline;\"><p style=\"border: 0px; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">* 홈페이지주소 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://edu.thein.kr/thein/member/courseDetail?degreeIdx=81\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75);\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">https://edu.thein.kr/thein/member/courseDetail?degreeIdx=81</span></a>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">정</span></span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">부(과기부) 에서&nbsp; 취업준비생을 대상으로 진행하는 전액 무료연수 + 기업연수 프로그램 입니다.</span></strong><br><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">=============================== 세부내용 ============================</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">- 모집기간 : 5월 19일(목) 오후 6시까지</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">- 연수기간 : 2022년 5월24일~2022년 11월30일</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">- 연수장소 : 더인에듀 교육센터</span><br><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">- 지원자격 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"gmail-il\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">이공</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">계 대졸(전문대졸 포함) 미취업자</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;( 88년 1월1일 이후 출생자 ) * 만34세이하</span></div><div style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb